{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55839","headline":"龙首山 · 钱熙","name":"龙首山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"残年仍置闰，五日恰逢春。\n携酒客不赏，敲门僧不嗔。\n双松如拱立，万井自横廹。\n精舍故盘礴，元规尘上人。\n（同治《泉州府志》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱熙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55839.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55839","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}